{"numsheets":7,"currentid":"sheet1","currentname":"sheet4","sheetArr":{"sheet1":{"sheetstr":{"savestr":"version:1.5\ncell:C3:t:HELP:f:1:c:3:bg:1:cf:1:colspan:7\ncell:C5:t:Sample Account Balance comprising of Sample Account Balance sheet is an example to understand the Account Balance application. The focus of the Sample sheet is to help user understand how Account Balance should be maintained by a user. The user can also remove the sample values individually by clicking on cross button, and can maintain it as a separate Account Balance for the family members or business partner simultaneously.:colspan:7\ncell:C7:t:Account Balance comprising of Account Balance sheet is for maintaining transaction records for your enterprise or personal use.:bg:2:colspan:7\ncell:C9:t:Explanation of tables in Sample and Account Balance sheets.:colspan:7\ncell:C11:t:Column Name:b:2:2:2:2:c:3:bg:1:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:D11:b:2:2:2:2:c:3:bg:1\ncell:E11:t:Description:b:2:2:2:2:c:3:bg:1:cf:1:colspan:5\ncell:B12:b::1::\ncell:C12:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:E12:b::1::1:colspan:5\ncell:J12:b::::1\ncell:B13:b::1::\ncell:C13:t:Date:b::1::1:l:1:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:E13:t:Date of transaction. The date when the payment is due or the date when the payment is received.:b::1::1:colspan:5\ncell:J13:b::::1\ncell:B14:b::1::\ncell:C14:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:E14:b::1::1:colspan:5\ncell:J14:b::::1\ncell:B15:b::1::\ncell:C15:t:Description:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:D15:bg:2\ncell:E15:t:Details of the transaction.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:5\ncell:J15:b::::1\ncell:B16:b::1::\ncell:C16:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:E16:b::1::1:colspan:5\ncell:J16:b::::1\ncell:B17:b::1::\ncell:C17:t:Payee:b::1::1:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:E17:t:To whom payment is made.:b::1::1:colspan:5\ncell:J17:b::::1\ncell:B18:b::1::\ncell:C18:b::1::1:colspan:2\ncell:E18:b::1::1:colspan:5\ncell:J18:b::::1\ncell:B19:b::1::\ncell:C19:t:Debit:b::1::1:bg:2:cf:1:colspan:2\ncell:D19:bg:2\ncell:E19:t:Amount withdrawn.:b::1::1:bg:2:colspan:5\ncell:J19:b::::1\nce